# The campaign through the menus (docs/re/campaign_phase7.md), 1280x720, 60 fps
# clock, with an EMPTY save dir (no options.txt -> the update news first; no
# cmp1prog.txt -> a fresh campaign):
#   mkdir -p /tmp/py_cmp && rm -f /tmp/py_cmp/*
#   SDL_VIDEODRIVER=offscreen ./build-game/ProjectY --data data --save-dir /tmp/py_cmp \
#       --frames 1510 --input tools/ui/campaign_flow.input
# Path: update news -> Back -> Singleplayer -> Campaign (screen 25: "Start
# Campaign", 0 % done) -> Start -> the loading screen (chapter, episode,
# cmp1_cut_1.jpg) -> mission 301 with Central Command's avatar -> a scripted
# win (the mission's own "gamestate result(1) player(1)") -> aftermath
# "Victory!" with Continue / Main menu (episode 1.2 unlocked, cmp1prog.txt
# written) -> Main menu -> Singleplayer -> Campaign ("Continue", 6 % done,
# Replay enabled) -> Replay Episode -> the progress screen (26) with episodes
# 1 and 2 of chapter 1.
